@codelaw/rules-spell / codelaw-rules-spell

The rules are codelaw's own (SR-SPELL). No code, word list, option or message
is taken from another spell checker, and no word comes from a published list
of common misspellings (SR-SPELL decision 6).

data/spell/typos.json is generated by codelaw's scripts/spell-data.py from the
two sources below, and from no other (L11 §3, D-42 and D-44). It holds
variants of words, not the sources' lists: single-edit misspellings of SCOWL's
most common words, with the word each comes from.

SCOWL (Spell Checker Oriented Word Lists), release 2020.12.07
(http://wordlist.aspell.net/, scowl-2020.12.07.tar.gz,
